{"id":"influencia","lemma":"influencia","pos":"noun","rank":2223,"glosses":["influence, clout","leverage"],"ipa":"/inˈflwenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"influencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-influencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es una mala influencia.","en":"He's a bad influence.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"suitcase"},null]},{"text":"Él puede usar sus influencias para ti.","en":"He can pull strings for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803879","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to use"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"Sé quién está usando sus influencias.","en":"I know who's pulling the strings.","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to use","l":"usar"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"La influencia de la ciencia en la sociedad es grande.","en":"The impact of science on society is great.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77121","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"science"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"society, social order"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"big, large"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"No conduzcas bajo la influencia del alcohol.","en":"Don't drive under the influence of alcohol.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to drive","l":"conducir"},{"g":"short"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"alcohol"}]}]}